{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20717","headline":"送王储詹事西游献兵书 · 卢仝","name":"送王储詹事西游献兵书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"美酒拨醅酌，杨花飞尽时。\n落日长安道，方寸无人知。\n箧中制胜术，气雄屈指筭。\n半醉千殷勤，仰天一长叹。\n玉匣百链劒，龟文又龙吼。\n抽赠王将军，勿使虚白首。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢仝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20717.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20717","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}